REM BY: from the RISC OS BBC BASIC manual, keywords chapter
REM BY is part of MOVE, DRAW, POINT and FILL; BBC BASIC (Z80) under
REM CP/M has no graphics, so the manual's examples give the error Sorry
x%=2:y%=3
MOVE BY 4*x%,4*y%
DRAW BY x%*16, y%*4
FILL BY x%, y%
10 ON ERROR PRINT ERR;" ";REPORT$;" at line ";ERL:END
20 PRINT "move"
30 MOVE BY 4*x%,4*y%
RUN
NEW
